Author: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date:   Thu Aug 27 20:00:14 2026 +0000

    Prefer missing Hosthub climate-tax stays when filling the 500-per-cycle cap.
    
    The 22 Aug rate-limit wipe left ct=0 on almost every booking. SRV 101 then
    sorted all 90-day events by checkout date, so future stays and unpaid
    preparations filled the cap and the backlog never drained. Fetch missing
    paid stays first, keep a 50-slot refresh, and reset fetchPages 429 retries
    per page.

